      {
        "id": 15,
        "payload": {
          "text": "## Section 1: Scope and Eligibility\n\nThis policy applies to all SUTD faculty, staff, and approved contractors who incur meal expenses during university-related business activities. Eligible activities include:\n\n- Official meetings with external partners, vendors, or collaborators\n- Conference attendance (domestic or international)\n- Field research activities requiring overnight stay\n- Project-related travel approved by department head\n- Business entertainment of prospective students, donors, or industry partners\n\nMeal claims for personal purposes, social gatherings, or routine daily meals at the workplace are NOT eligible.",
          "file": "meals.md",
          "category": "meals",
          "section": "Section 1: Scope and Eligibility"
        },
