      {
        "id": 16,
        "payload": {
          "text": "## Section 2: Daily Meal Caps\n\nAll meal reimbursements are subject to the following daily caps per meal type:\n\n### Section 2.1: Breakfast\nMaximum reimbursable amount: **SGD 15.00** per person (hard cap)\n\nBreakfast claims must be accompanied by a receipt showing date, time, and itemized list if total exceeds SGD 10.\n\n### Section 2.2: Lunch\nMaximum reimbursable amount: **SGD 20.00** per person (hard cap)\n\nLunch claims require original receipt with merchant name and date. For claims above SGD 15, itemized breakdown is mandatory.\n\n### Section 2.3: Dinner\nMaximum reimbursable amount: **SGD 30.00** per person (hard cap)\n\nDinner claims must include original receipt with full itemization if total exceeds SGD 20. Claims for dinner before 6:00 PM require written justification.\n\n### Section 2.4: Total Daily Cap\nMaximum total meal reimbursement per day: **SGD 50.00** per person\n\nThis cap applies to the sum of breakfast, lunch, and dinner claims on a single calendar day. Claims exceeding SGD 50 in aggregate will be rejected unless pre-approved by department head for exceptional circumstances.",
          "file": "meals.md",
          "category": "meals",
          "section": "Section 2: Daily Meal Caps"
        },
