      {
        "id": 17,
        "payload": {
          "text": "## Section 3: Business Meal Entertainment\n\nBusiness meals involving external guests or clients are subject to additional rules:\n\n### Section 3.1: Pre-Approval Requirement\nMeals exceeding **SGD 100 total** (for all attendees combined) require advance approval via the Expense Pre-Approval Form (EPF-01). Submit at least 3 business days prior to the event.\n\n### Section 3.2: Attendee Limit\nMaximum **8 attendees** per business meal. Meals with more than 8 attendees require written justification and VP-level approval.\n\n### Section 3.3: Documentation\nAll business meal claims must include:\n- Original itemized receipt showing food/beverage breakdown\n- List of attendees with names and affiliations\n- Brief description of business purpose (1-2 sentences)\n- For claims above SGD 200: meeting agenda or formal invitation\n\n### Section 3.4: Gratuity and Service Charges\nService charges and gratuity are reimbursable up to 15% of the pre-tax meal cost. Tips exceeding 15% require written justification.",
          "file": "meals.md",
          "category": "meals",
          "section": "Section 3: Business Meal Entertainment"
        },
