      {
        "id": 18,
        "payload": {
          "text": "## Section 4: Overseas Meal Allowances\n\nFor approved international travel, meal caps are adjusted as follows:\n\n### Section 4.1: Approved Destinations\nOverseas meal allowance applies to destinations listed in the University Travel Destination Register. For unlisted destinations, contact Finance for per diem rates.\n\n### Section 4.2: Overseas Multiplier\nMeal caps for overseas travel are **1.5x domestic caps**:\n- Breakfast: SGD 22.50\n- Lunch: SGD 30.00\n- Dinner: SGD 45.00\n- Total daily cap: SGD 75.00\n\n### Section 4.3: Currency Conversion\nAll foreign currency receipts will be converted to SGD at the exchange rate on the date of expense. Use the university's automated currency converter or submit exchange rate proof from xe.com or OANDA.\n\n### Section 4.4: Meals Included in Conference Registration\nIf conference registration includes meals, those meals are NOT claimable separately. Conference agenda must be attached to verify included meal schedule.",
          "file": "meals.md",
          "category": "meals",
          "section": "Section 4: Overseas Meal Allowances"
        },
